{"key":"keys.openai","type":"string","constraints":"non-empty","default":"none","overrides":"`--api-key` > `keys.openai` > provider env var (`OPENAI_API_KEY`) > config `api_key` > `TAU_API_KEY`","description":"API key for the `openai` provider — a keys[] entry outranks that provider's env var and the global api_key.","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/config.md"}
